# 4. Single vs Double Quotes

| Quote        | Variable Expansion | Example              | Output        |
| ------------ | ------------------ | -------------------- | ------------- |
| Double `" "` | Yes                | `echo "Hello $NAME"` | `Hello Aarti` |
| Single `' '` | No                 | `echo 'Hello $NAME'` | `Hello $NAME` |

