# 6. Command-Line Arguments

| Variable | Meaning                         |
| -------- | ------------------------------- |
| `$0`     | Script name                     |
| `$1`     | First argument                  |
| `$2`     | Second argument                 |
| `$#`     | Number of arguments             |
