# 13. For Loops

### List-Based

```bash
for fruit in apple banana mango orange grape; do
    echo "$fruit"
done
```

### Number Loop

```bash
for i in 1 2 3 4 5; do
    echo "$i"
done
```

### C-Style Loop

```bash
