# 20. Function Return Values

### Return Exit Status

```bash
check_file() {
    if [ -f "$1" ]; then
        return 0
    else
        return 1
    fi
}
```

Check result:

```bash
check_file "notes.txt"

if [ $? -eq 0 ]; then
    echo "File exists"
fi
```

### Return Actual Data

Use `echo`:

```bash
get_name() {
    echo "Aarti"
}

NAME=$(get_name)

echo "$NAME"
```

