# 39. Backup Pattern

### Create Timestamp

```bash
DATE=$(date +%Y-%m-%d)
```

### Create Compressed Backup

```bash
tar -czf "backup-${DATE}.tar.gz" /source/directory
```

### Verify

```bash
if [ -f "backup-${DATE}.tar.gz" ]; then
    echo "Backup created successfully"
fi
```

