# 40. Cron Cheat Sheet

### Cron Format

```text
* * * * * command
│ │ │ │ │
│ │ │ │ └── Day of week
│ │ │ └──── Month
│ │ └────── Day of month
│ └──────── Hour
└────────── Minute
```

| Requirement          | Cron          |
| -------------------- | ------------- |
| Every 5 minutes      | `*/5 * * * *` |
| Every day at 2 AM    | `0 2 * * *`   |
| Every Sunday at 3 AM | `0 3 * * 0`   |
| View jobs            | `crontab -l`  |
| Edit jobs            | `crontab -e`  |

